<title>Somalia: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/somalia/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-somalia-2026-11-08T06:24:33.304Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 08 Nov 2026 06:24:33 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Somalia's Supreme Court declared President Hassan Sheikh Mohamud's term extension unlawful and the court chief reported threats to his life as armed forces seized the court. Al-Shabaab militants attacked a police station and camp in Garissa, and the Somali government warned that Houthi support could boost al-Shabaab's attack capabilities. The Somali police deputy chief warned of a security vacuum as Ugandan troops withdraw from the country. US forces vacated the Baledogle airfield after more than a decade of use. The conflict caused 2,284 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiW0FVX3lxTE1SVFpORU5zQkRLVkp2OWNJWGplQWhXeFE5NkN4UXpOSGtzaVZNUzBfRXZ5cUxKMDliWGZ6a2I3bVMyRko4MlphZmpPdXgyVnRRcHlwdF96ZmxLems?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Hiiraan Online&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimwFBVV95cUxOamU1aHBIaThGdlJGUnBmM2ZyZUVJaXo0ckk3dF84NHBiU1ZHVTE2WEd0TlhrN3lRblBXYXB0Y05FQnhJaGUxQ2I3RFFjdURUMmxPRzYyOXVTajEzZVhkS2FybzBUOTdtVW9EdW5CaW1pZFhqeXVDOVlyendHRDRBX3M3eFFqZEVaczRmVzU2X3ljejBlcjNON3ExOA?oc=5&quot;&gt;horn review&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMi-?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sunatimes.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimAFBVV95cUxQRVotWTZUUTBaUjRvYV91WUhZdGp4dUV2c0J1Q3FWRldHVDFlOGZYSlUyVDR3YlVMdjNVSHdfU3Q1MlN6eU5GOUxkelh6X1ZDbC0zSTc4WWc4SnhfM2toLUZsaVZ0S3lBREZRSmRNTnFaWXVTWHlMOE1kRVczTkxjT0JjMzJESjNSdFdoNWZPV2JzcEdCaE9UTA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Daily Monitor&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwgFBVV95cUxNQzRTTFlYakw2WUUybFk0OWdoMzVxbHR3ckFLbVVnb21DRmJOenFVb3ZSS3lDWDlvTXZuUG9fOFcyN3JrUko0MERUMWVwTXRTQm9qUjcxRk1xaWNqbENuSmpEeS1MQzhLWmpiaXRsU2U4ZFhiWnFjbGtCbEtjSENOS3h1b1hJdW5RR3